# Variant: bare AArch64 Image instead of a PE/EFI-stub image.
# Some vendor ABLs jump straight to the Image header and never go through an
# EFI entry point, so the MZ header can make the handoff fail silently.
# CONFIG_EFI is not set
# CONFIG_EFI_STUB is not set
# CONFIG_EFI_GENERIC_STUB_INITRD_CMDLINE_LOADER is not set
# CONFIG_RANDOMIZE_BASE is not set
